rate, power, and handling, turning it into a true force of destruction. Strengthen your buildings to support frontline combat and give your crew the edge they need. Increasing your Xenite Level unlocks powerful Support Modules that can shift the outcome of any fight. Every upgrade fuels survival - and domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you unlock the planet's hidden secrets, make allies among the unknown, and ensure the legacy of your kind survives in &quot;Solitary Horizons&quot;? <i>The universe awaits your decision; the world is yours to explore</i>.</p>","developers":["PaceBloom"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147620/07589f0e940f762e0214f5ee967a02b1c8a92fbc/header.jpg?t=1763838396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147620/793011/34d986de149f6e2c0554c523e7b8f46f5b469ba6/1750875038/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732968687","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147620/793011/34d986de149f6e2c0554c523e7b8f46f5b469ba6/1750875038/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732968687","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147620/793011/34d986de149f6e2c0554c523e7b8f46f5b469ba6/1750875038/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732968687","id":257077753,"name":"Solitary Horizons | Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077753/1618d0c46dff372c7bf9b26c459a9499a091834b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1732968687"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147620/883653/96906d66d42a5de41d73d7b52329bca393d13bd6/1750875039/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746264953","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3147620/883653/96906d66d42a5de41d73d7b52329bca393d13bd6/1750875039/das